  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5917.17 Procedure for the Administration of Fines",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5917.17 Procedure for the Administration of Fines. When the division has determined through an inspection conducted in accordance with Saf-C 5917.11 or an investigation conducted in accordance with Saf-C 5922 that a violation of RSA 153-A or these rules has occurred, the commissioner shall impose a fine in accordance with RSA 153-A:22 and Saf-C 5922.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5900.html"
